<view class="page entry-page">
  <view class="eyebrow">开开华彩 · 活动回忆</view>
  <view class="title">把精彩时刻，<br/>保存到手机相册</view>
  <view class="muted entry-lead">收到朋友分享的小程序相册卡片，点开即可看照片和视频。无需注册、无需输入密码。</view>
  <view class="card entry-card">
    <view class="entry-card-title">已有网页相册链接？</view>
    <view class="muted">活动主办方可在这里粘贴原来的相册链接，打开后再分享小程序卡片给大家。</view>
    <input class="link-input" value="{{link}}" bindinput="onInput" placeholder="粘贴活动相册分享链接" placeholder-class="input-placeholder"/>
    <button class="button button-primary entry-open" bindtap="onOpen">打开活动相册</button>
    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="entry-error">{{error}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="notice entry-notice">保存照片或视频时，微信会询问是否允许添加到系统相册；只在您点“保存”时申请权限。</view>
</view>
